window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Notice of Eviction!</b></p> <p>Dan—an average guy trying to enjoy a temporary job assignment in Puerto Rico—finds himself in a deadly game of cat and mouse when he unintentionally discovers a mysterious stone. Forced to run for his life, he reaches out to his best friend Aleecia Donnelly.</p> <p>Aleecia—who lives within a meticulously cultivated routine that avoids most people and side-steps conflict—is launched into a harrowing search for an ancient artifact, and is cast into the covert world of the Crew, a clandestine group fighting the eviction process facing humankind. Now Aleecia must transform from a self-imposed seclusionist to guardian of the masses or millions may die.</p> <p>This compelling combination of history and myth will suggest a radical alternative to evolution that explores a newfound reality and examines everything believed to be factual about our world. Science fiction meets thriller in this twisting tale of ancestral warfare.</p> <p>For fans of <i>The Kingsman</i>, <i>The X-Files</i>, <i>Independence Day </i>and <i>Ancient Aliens</i>. Get it now and unravel the mystery of the Stones!</p>"; 
